[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2909570580","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/106774#issuecomment-2909570580","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/106774","id":2909570580,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6tbIYU","user":{"login":"VojtaStruhar","id":49688205,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ5Njg4MjA1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/49688205?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/VojtaStruhar","html_url":"https://github.com/VojtaStruhar","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VojtaStruhar/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VojtaStruhar/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VojtaStruhar/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VojtaStruhar/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VojtaStruhar/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VojtaStruhar/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VojtaStruhar/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VojtaStruhar/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VojtaStruhar/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-05-26T12:26:27Z","updated_at":"2025-05-26T12:26:27Z","body":"I once had a similar issue. I have two _Godot projects_ directories and each one has a symlink to the other. When I opened the project manager, each project was included **many** times in the projects list, with the paths showing it keeps going deeper and deeper around the symlink loop. \n\nMy guess is that it stops looping only after reaching the maximum file path limit (I think that's 1023 characters for MacOS). I removed the symlink, but I feel that for your case Godot should avoid going down recursive symlinks. Somehow.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengin